  "description": "LTX 2.5 text-to-video and image-to-video with Stubelius Remix beta 2, a community LTX 2.5 checkpoint that carries the 2D/stylized and NSFW lineage of TenStrip's LTX 2.3 finetunes (10Eros, Sulphur 2) onto LTX 2.5 by task-vector arithmetic, with the LTX distilled LoRA merged in. It is an anime-first model: 2D / 2.5D and stylized characters stay stylized where REDgraft drifts toward semi-real, and live-action prompts still come out realistic. Measured against REDgraft on the same graph, prompts and seeds (2026-09-23, 4 prompts x 2 seeds): it followed staging less reliably (a character never turned to camera, a second character never arrived, 2 of 2 seeds each) and took about twice as long per clip. Treat it as an NSFW model: on clothed prompts it still sexualises women (see-through or ridden-up clothing on 3 of 3 clothed test prompts, including one that specified a buttoned-up raincoat), so it is not suitable for SFW work. Same two-pass graphs, companion files and settings as the REDgraft pack (CFG 1, 8 steps + upscale), so only the 21.5 GB model is new if REDgraft is installed. Requires a HuggingFace API key (Settings > API Keys) and one-time acceptance of the LTX 2.5 licence at https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5 for the shared encoder and VAEs. Licence: LTX-2 Community License; check the base and donor model licences before commercial use. Adult-capable model, for consenting-adult creative work only.",
